  "description": "Everyone on campus knows the rich and handsome Jung Woo-Jin, so when a guy like that offers to buy him a meal, Kang Seo-Ju agrees immediately and that might have been the biggest mistake of his life. When Seo-Ju regains consciousness, he finds himself stranded on a deserted island with just Woo-Jin, unsure of how much time has passed. Woo-Jin confesses to being hopelessly in love with him and is determined to make Seo-Ju his, regardless of how Seo-Ju feels. But as their entanglement grows, Seo-Ju starts to wonder if this truly is their first time meeting. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
